+    // 1800-2017 27.4: a genvar declared in a loop's initialisation is local
+    // to that loop, so two sibling `for(genvar i = ...)` loops each have
+    // their own `i`. Elaboration runs the loops one after another and hands
+    // the generated items a single scope, so rather than give the genvar a
